    "original_requirement": "实现一个药品冷链运输箱监测系统，使用温度传感器 LM35（A1）、震动传感器 D2、门磁 D3、GPS 模拟数据通过串口输入、TM1637（CLK=D4，DIO=D5）、蜂鸣器 D6 和 LED D13。系统记录温度异常、开箱事件和剧烈震动次数，轮流显示当前温度和异常计数；一旦温度超过上限或运输过程中开箱，则立即报警并串口输出带位置的事件日志。",
    "effective_requirement": "实现一个药品冷链运输箱监测系统，使用温度传感器 LM35（A1）、震动传感器 D2、门磁 D3、GPS 模拟数据通过串口输入、TM1637（CLK=D4，DIO=D5）、蜂鸣器 D6 和 LED D13。系统记录温度异常、开箱事件和剧烈震动次数，轮流显示当前温度和异常计数；一旦温度超过上限或运输过程中开箱，则立即报警并串口输出带位置的事件日志。\nResolved hardware configuration (authoritative pin assignments; original conflicts were explicitly remapped). This is a PARTIAL inventory of recognized roles, not a whitelist: all other explicit source wiring remains required. device_role identifies wiring only, not the final catalog operation: preserve requested PWM, calibration, thresholds, timers and all other behavior.\n{\"version\": \"configuration-defaults-v3\", \"board\": \"arduino:avr:uno\", \"devices\": [{\"device_role\": \"analog_input\", \"pin\": \"A1\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_output\", \"pin\": \"D13\"}, {\"device_role\": \"tone_output\", \"pin\": \"D6\"}, {\"device_role\": \"tm1637_number\", \"clk_pin\": \"D4\", \"dio_pin\": \"D5\"}], \"serial\": {\"baud\": 9600, \"framing\": \"line_or_idle\", \"idle_timeout_ms\": 20, \"commands\": {\"CLK\": 1, \"DIO\": 2}}}\nSerial baud=9600; framing=line_or_idle; idle_timeout_ms=20.",
